--- !u!114 &5335745909752580289
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4877835952885910451}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9ab50905f41718146bdccc08b59128d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FairyNpc
  fairyName: Fairy
  flyFrames:
  - {fileID: -1747358730, guid: 9f601ebba39c4fe48b2f0accf13af4f0, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -544121591, guid: 9f601ebba39c4fe48b2f0accf13af4f0, type: 3}
  flyFps: 6
  bobHeight: 0.18
  bobSpeed: 2
  glowColor: {r: 0.7, g: 1, b: 0.8, a: 0.28}
  portraitIdle: {fileID: -1250959855, guid: 3c22ff1c1a9bb81409490088cf158c3f, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: -1149047858, guid: 3c22ff1c1a9bb81409490088cf158c3f, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: 1308293042, guid: 3c22ff1c1a9bb81409490088cf158c3f, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -1896401758, guid: 3c22ff1c1a9bb81409490088cf158c3f, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.55, b: 0.35, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Oh! A visitor... and you don't smell of shadow. Hello, little farmer.
  - I am the keeper of this grove. The pollution crept in slowly, and now it chokes the forest paths. Everything here is wilting.
  - If you would help me, perhaps the forest can breathe again.
  fromSisterPages:
  - Oh... you have spoken to my little sister? I could feel her worry from here. You came all this way for her. Thank you.
  aboutPollution:
  - The dark stuff seeps up from the farm and the mountain, carried by water and wind. The animals were the first to change.
  - Clean it away at the source, and the shadows will let them go. I think. I hope.
  allDone:
  - The forest is breathing easier because of you. Come and sit by the pond whenever you like.
  quests:
  - id: shadows_1
    title: Quiet the Shadows
    kind: 1
    offerPages:
    - The shadow animals were my friends once. Rabbits, squirrels... all twisted by the dark.
    - If you banish eight of them, the paths will be safer, and maybe the pollution will loosen its hold.
    reminder: Eight shadows, little farmer. They hide in the maze rooms.
    completePages:
    - I can feel it. The forest is breathing a little deeper. Thank you!
    items: []
    counterKey: shadows_banished
    counterTarget: 8
    countFromAccept: 1
    counterLabel: Shadows banished
    rewardGold: 120
    rewardItems: []
    setFlag: 
  - id: stone_1
    title: Cleansing Stones
    kind: 0
    offerPages:
    - Stone can hold a spell, if the stone is clean. The mountain has plenty.
    - Bring me some, and I'll set them around the pond to keep the pollution out.
    reminder: Stones from the mountain, please. They must be clean.
    completePages:
    - Perfect. I'll set these around the water tonight.
    items:
    - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2310c5952ef76a74aba89d6e9c004a8f, type: 2}
      count: 10
    counterKey: shadows_banished
    counterTarget: 10
    countFromAccept: 1
    counterLabel: Shadows banished
    rewardGold: 150
    rewardItems: []
    setFlag: 
  - id: harvest_1
    title: Seeds of Hope
    kind: 0
    offerPages:
    - Things grow slowly here now. Fresh produce from the farm carries living magic.
    - Could you bring me a basket? I'll plant the seeds where the shadows once stood.
    reminder: Fresh things from the farm, please.
    completePages:
    - Oh, these are wonderful. Already the soil feels warmer.
    items:
    - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db0b4bbca1f1b064182f4bb119d6cb66, type: 2}
      count: 8
    counterKey: shadows_banished
    counterTarget: 10
    countFromAccept: 1
    counterLabel: Shadows banished
    rewardGold: 200
    rewardItems: []
    setFlag: 
  - id: shadows_2
    title: Hunters of the Dark
    kind: 1
    offerPages:
    - There are more. So many more. The pollution keeps making them.
    - Twenty-five this time. Then I think we can look for where it all comes from.
    reminder: Keep going. Every shadow you free is a friend returned.
    completePages:
    - You've done what I could not for years. Now... we need to find the source.
    items: []
    counterKey: shadows_banished
    counterTarget: 25
    countFromAccept: 1
    counterLabel: Shadows banished
    rewardGold: 400
    rewardItems: []
    setFlag: 
  - id: story_placeholder
    title: (Story placeholder) The Source
    kind: 1
    offerPages:
    - '[Placeholder] This is where the main story continues: where the pollution comes from, and how to stop it.'
    reminder: '[Placeholder] Rewrite this quest to match your story.'
    completePages:
    - '[Placeholder] To be continued...'
